### 🌺 English contemplative conclusion

The scriptures do not manufacture Brahman, nor does the teacher create the Self. Their purpose is to remove the confusion through which the ever-present Self appears unknown.

Just as blossoms reveal the arrival of spring without creating the season, the words of wisdom direct the seeker toward what is already true.

The culmination of spiritual study is not an accumulation of descriptions, but the clear recognition of the Self that is never absent
